SUMMARY:Aaron Lee Tasjan
LOCATION:Parlor Room\, 32 Masonic St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Madeleine Kelson\nAaron Lee Tasjan was experiencing the wo
 rst bout of imposter syndrome of his career when he sat down and wrote Tod
 d Snider a vulnerable email asking for advice. Tasjan\, despite writing an
 d recording some of the most astute Americana rock songs of the last decad
 e and being nominated for a Grammy\, just didn’t see a future for an ind
 ependent singer\, songwriter\, and guitarist like himself.\nhttps://thepar
 lorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000BPp7RMAT\nFrom P
